{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T16:57:37+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T16:57:37+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Sartorius Aktiengesellschaft","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Instruments & Supplies","country":"Germany","city":"Göttingen","website":"https://www.sartorius.com","employees":14273,"summary":"Sartorius Aktiengesellschaft provides bioprocess solutions, and lab products and services worldwide. The company offers analytical solutions, such as biolayer interferometry systems, high-throughput screening by cytometry systems, process analytical technology and data analytics, cell selection and retrieval, live-cell imaging and analysis systems, and surface plasmon resonance systems; cell culture solutions, including bioreactors and fermenters, cell culture reagents, supplements and matrices, nucleic acid and delivery solutions, cell culture media, and cell lines and buffers; and fluid management products. It also provides lab filtration and purification solutions, lab water purification systems, microtissue technologies, lab weighing, pipettes, tips and dispensers, microbiological testing solutions, lab data and fleet management software, and OEM solutions; and Process chromatography and filtration solutions. The company serves the life science research, biopharmaceutical manufacturing, cell and gene therapy, and applied industries. The company was founded in 1870 and is headquartered in Göttingen, Germany.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Sartorius Aktiengesellschaft fournit des solutions de bioprocédés et des produits et services de laboratoire dans le monde entier. La société propose des solutions analytiques, telles que des systèmes d'interférométrie de biocouche, un criblage à haut débit par des systèmes de cytométrie, des technologies d'analyse de processus et d'analyse de données, la sélection et la récupération de cellules, des systèmes d'imagerie et d'analyse de cellules vivantes et des systèmes de résonance plasmonique de surface; des solutions de culture cellulaire, y compris des bioréacteurs et des fermenteurs, des réactifs de culture cellulaire, des suppléments et des matrices. Il fournit également des solutions de filtration et de purification de laboratoire, des systèmes de purification d'eau de laboratoire, des technologies de microtissus, du pesage de laboratoire, des pipettes, des embouts et des distributeurs, des solutions de tests microbiologiques, des logiciels de gestion de données de laboratoire et de flotte et des solutions OEM; et des solutions de chromatographie et de filtration de processus."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":20045879296,"shares_outstanding":34813621,"trailing_pe":91.2893,"forward_pe":45.45924,"price_to_book":7.405801,"ev_to_ebitda":26.077,"ev_to_revenue":6.959,"dividend_yield":0.0025,"payout_ratio":0.2342,"beta_yahoo":1.451},"targets":{"current_price":290.3,"mean":289.8421,"median":300.0,"high":330.0,"low":200.0,"n_analysts":19,"reco_mean":1.73684,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":[],"eps_avg":1.50727,"eps_low":1.45,"eps_high":1.62,"revenue_avg":999768780,"ex_dividend":"2026-03-27","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.25611,"institutions_pct":0.30504,"institutions_float_pct":0.41006002,"institutions_n":309,"institutions":[{"name":"Mar Vista Investment Partners, LLC","pct":0.0,"shares":62,"value":17998,"date":"2025-06-30","chg":0.0}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD WORLD FUND-Vanguard International Growth Fund","pct":0.0378,"shares":1415584,"value":410944017,"date":"2026-05-31","chg":-0.065},{"name":"Franklin Custodian Funds-FRANKLIN GROWTH FUND","pct":0.0121,"shares":453990,"value":131793291,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"Prudential World Fd., Inc.-PGIM Jennison Intl Opportunities Fd.","pct":0.0075,"shares":281516,"value":81724091,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.4168},{"name":"T. Rowe Pr